WEBVTT

00:02.377 --> 00:05.171
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.255 --> 00:06.881
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.965 --> 00:08.550
Kids  :
Aye, aye, Captain.
儿童：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.633 --> 00:11.678
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.761 --> 00:13.680
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.763 --> 00:15.974
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:16.057 --> 00:17.767
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.851 --> 00:20.103
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:20.186 --> 00:21.896
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.190
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:24.274 --> 00:26.234
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:26.317 --> 00:27.652
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.736 --> 00:29.446
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:29.529 --> 00:31.114
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.197 --> 00:32.532
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:32.615 --> 00:34.617
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:34.701 --> 00:37.245
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:54.471 --> 01:00.769
SpongeBob: ♪ Ohh... ♪
海绵宝宝：♪哦...♪

01:00.852 --> 01:04.022
♪ How much chum
could a sea slug chug
if a sea slug could chug... ♪
♪ 多少密友
海蛞蝓能发出突突声吗
如果海蛞蝓能发出嘎嘎声……♪

01:09.986 --> 01:12.197
Mr. Krabs, you gotta
get out here.
蟹老板，你必须
出去吧。

01:12.280 --> 01:14.199
It's a code blue situation!
这是蓝色代码的情况！

01:14.282 --> 01:17.076
Please deposit 25 cents
to continue this call.
请存入25美分
继续此通话。

01:17.160 --> 01:19.329
Uh, sure thing, Mr. K.
呃，当然可以，K 先生。

01:21.164 --> 01:22.749
Mr. Krabs, you gotta
get out here!
蟹老板，你必须
出去吧！

01:22.832 --> 01:24.834
It's a code blue situation.
这是蓝色代码的情况。

01:24.918 --> 01:26.795
Code blue?
蓝色代码？

01:26.878 --> 01:28.922
What's the matter, boy?
怎么了，孩子？

01:29.005 --> 01:31.341
I think Plankton wants to
destroy our way of life.
我认为浮游生物想要
破坏我们的生活方式。

01:31.424 --> 01:33.927
Man alive, he's taking us down.
还活着的人，他正在把我们打倒。

01:35.929 --> 01:39.474
get ready, Krabs,
for the surprise of your life.
准备好吧，蟹蟹们
为您的生活带来惊喜。

01:41.893 --> 01:46.189
Brace yourselves.
做好准备。

01:46.272 --> 01:49.442
Huh?
啊？

01:49.526 --> 01:52.153
Plankton's destroying
the chum bucket?
浮游生物的破坏
密友桶？

01:52.237 --> 01:55.657
I guess
he's finally given up
on the restaurant business.
我猜
他终于放弃了
关于餐饮业。

01:55.740 --> 01:58.201
Couldn't take the competition.
无法参加比赛。

02:02.622 --> 02:06.918
What is that?
那是什么？

02:07.001 --> 02:10.463
Greetings, citizens
of Bikini Bottom.
各位公民，您好
的比基尼底部。

02:10.547 --> 02:13.591
Behold my imperial
chum coliseum.
看我的帝国
密友体育馆。

02:18.137 --> 02:21.683
I vow to introduce
to this fair city culture
我发誓要介绍
对这个公平的城市文化

02:21.766 --> 02:24.143
in the form of
hand-to-hand grappling.
形式为
徒手格斗。

02:28.690 --> 02:31.734
I intend to enrich
your lives culturally
我打算丰富
你的文化生活

02:31.818 --> 02:35.697
by exhibiting the moist
spectacle of gladiators
in mortal conflict.
通过展示湿润
角斗士的奇观
在生死的冲突中。

02:38.908 --> 02:43.621
My corporate underwriters told
me to mention that it's free.
我的公司承销商告诉我
我要提一下，它是免费的。

02:46.082 --> 02:47.876
come one, come all.
一个都来，一个都来。

02:47.959 --> 02:50.420
Remember, kids love gladiators.
请记住，孩子们喜欢角斗士。

02:50.503 --> 02:53.089
Wow, real live conflict?
哇，真实的冲突？

02:53.173 --> 02:54.507
For free?
免费？

02:54.591 --> 02:56.467
Let the horror show begin.
让恐怖表演开始吧。

03:05.435 --> 03:09.230
Oh, Karen, even though
you're just a frigid machine
哦，凯伦，尽管如此
你只是一台冰冷的机器

03:09.314 --> 03:13.026
your circuits must be
welling up with emotion
at my latest achievement.
你的电路必须是
情绪激动
在我的最新成就中。

03:13.109 --> 03:18.031
Karen: Oh, yes, my resistors
are simply gushing
from their copper foil traces.
凯伦：哦，是的，我的电阻
只是涌出
从他们的铜箔痕迹。

03:18.114 --> 03:22.118
This will prove to be
my greatest evil scheme ever.
这将被证明是
我有史以来最大的邪恶计划。

03:22.201 --> 03:25.705
That's what you said
when you tried to boil Krabs
in a giant bisque.
这就是你说的
当你尝试煮蟹时
在一个巨大的浓汤中。

03:25.788 --> 03:28.291
I can still feel the burns.
我仍然能感觉到烧伤。

03:28.374 --> 03:32.337
Which is why I've removed
all molten liquid
from this maneuver.
这就是我删除的原因
所有熔融液体
从这个动作。

03:32.420 --> 03:36.883
And it's why this time  I  will be
the one with all the customers
这就是为什么这次我会
与所有顾客在一起的那一位

03:36.966 --> 03:41.012
and Krabs will be the pathetic
one in an empty restaurant
蟹蟹将是可悲的
一个在空荡荡的餐厅里

03:41.095 --> 03:43.473
stuck with a computer
for a wife.
被电脑困住了
为了一个妻子。

03:43.556 --> 03:45.224
Uh, sorry, honey.
呃，对不起，亲爱的。

03:47.477 --> 03:52.065
Wow, looks like Plankton
finally has some customers.
哇，看起来像浮游生物
终于有了一些客户。

03:52.148 --> 03:55.777
I agree...
It's very suspicious.
我同意...
这很可疑。

03:55.860 --> 03:59.906
And he may have lured a few of
our fair-weather customers in
with some cheap entertainment
他可能已经引诱了一些人
我们的全天候客户
一些廉价的娱乐活动

03:59.989 --> 04:03.660
but our loyal customers know
quality when they taste it.
但我们忠实的客户知道
当他们品尝时的品质。

04:03.743 --> 04:08.373
So let's get in there
and serve 'em up a burger they
tell their grand-guppies about.
那么让我们进去吧
并为他们提供汉堡
告诉他们的孔雀鱼大。

04:11.584 --> 04:14.087
Where's all me loyal customers?
我所有的忠实客户都在哪里？

04:14.170 --> 04:17.632
They've all taken their
grand-guppies to see the guts
and gore across the street.
他们都拿走了自己的
孔雀鱼看胆量
和街对面的血腥场面。

04:17.715 --> 04:23.429
Grr... That lower life form
can slander me name and
desecrate me mother's grave...
呃……那个低等生命体
可以诽谤我的名字和
亵渎我母亲的坟墓...

04:23.513 --> 04:25.306
I'm right here.
我就在这里。

04:25.390 --> 04:29.269
But when he steals me customers,
then I push back.
但当他抢走了我的顾客时
然后我又推回去。

04:29.352 --> 04:31.938
Gentlemen, to the coliseum.
先生们，到体育馆去。

04:38.403 --> 04:43.116
This reeks of evil, and
I'm gonna sniff out the source.
这充满了邪恶的气息，并且
我要去嗅探源头

04:48.871 --> 04:50.957
Welcome, one and all...
欢迎大家，大家...

04:51.040 --> 04:55.712
To the first biannual
big arena of annihilation.
到第一个双年度
歼灭大竞技场。

04:59.007 --> 05:01.551
Whoo!
呼！

05:01.634 --> 05:04.095
Brought to you by yours truly.
由您真实地带给您。

05:04.178 --> 05:09.475
So without further ado,
let the mauling begin.
所以，事不宜迟，
让殴打开始吧。

05:09.559 --> 05:11.519
All right.
好的。

05:11.602 --> 05:15.648
Yay.
耶。

05:19.402 --> 05:21.154
Whoo!
呼！

05:21.237 --> 05:23.740
Isn't this a boatload
of fun, Squidward?
这不是一船货吗
有趣吗，章鱼哥？

05:23.823 --> 05:27.326
I can't wait to see
the poor sucker who has to
go up against that beast.
我等不及要看
可怜的傻瓜必须
去对抗那只野兽。

05:27.410 --> 05:29.162
You call this fun?
你管这叫好玩？

05:29.245 --> 05:31.414
This is just cheap, uncultured
lay sport.
这只是廉价的，没有文化的
业余运动。

05:31.497 --> 05:34.334
Now release the opponent.
现在释放对手。

05:34.417 --> 05:35.835
Yes, go!
是的，走吧！

05:46.429 --> 05:48.806
Patrick?
帕特里克？

05:48.890 --> 05:50.475
How could they?
他们怎么能呢？

05:50.558 --> 05:53.728
This is horrible.
这太可怕了。

05:53.811 --> 05:57.523
This is fabulous.
这太棒了。

05:57.607 --> 05:59.025
Enough dilly-dallying.
磨蹭够了。

05:59.108 --> 06:03.488
Send out the blood sausages.
把血肠送出去。

06:04.739 --> 06:07.241
Oh, look.
哦，看。

06:09.535 --> 06:12.205
That pink dimwit
doesn't stand a chance
那个粉色的傻子
没有机会

06:12.288 --> 06:14.791
with those sausages
around his throat.
和那些香肠
在他的喉咙周围。

06:14.874 --> 06:19.045
As soon as the smell of sausage
hits that ravenous
lionfish's nostrils
一闻到香肠的香味
贪婪地击中
狮子鱼的鼻孔

06:19.128 --> 06:22.715
he'll be all over Patrick
like mold on a shower curtain.
他会成为帕特里克的全部
就像浴帘上的霉菌一样。

06:22.799 --> 06:25.176
Rip his sausages off!
把他的香肠撕下来！

06:27.470 --> 06:31.557
Whoa... Nice kitty.
哇……好可爱的小猫。

06:31.641 --> 06:33.810
Here, kitty, want a sausage?
来，小猫，想要一根香肠吗？

06:33.893 --> 06:38.564
A nice, delicious, tasty...
一个不错的，好吃的，好吃的...

06:38.648 --> 06:41.109
Sausage.
香肠。

06:42.735 --> 06:45.530
Spawn of a gefilte fish.
鱼丸的产卵。

06:45.613 --> 06:47.990
I can't sit here and watch this.
我不能坐在这里看这个。

06:48.074 --> 06:53.246
That's my best friend out there.
那是我最好的朋友。

06:59.168 --> 07:00.545
Huh?
啊？

07:00.628 --> 07:01.796
Patrick!
帕特里克！

07:01.879 --> 07:03.422
Oh, oh, it's you.
哦，哦，是你。

07:03.506 --> 07:04.924
Hey, how's it going, buddy?
嘿，怎么样，伙计？

07:05.007 --> 07:06.551
No time for chitchat, get in.
没时间闲聊了，进来吧。

07:06.634 --> 07:09.262
Hurry up, Nellie.
快点，内莉。

07:09.345 --> 07:11.264
Boo!
嘘！

07:11.347 --> 07:15.143
Boring... I want to see
some body parts.
无聊。。我想看看
一些身体部位。

07:15.226 --> 07:16.435
Mom...
妈妈...

07:17.854 --> 07:20.148
This is ridiculous.
这太荒谬了。

07:20.231 --> 07:24.902
I order a simple brutal mauling
for my denizens, and I get
a circus act.
我命令简单粗暴的殴打
对于我的居民，我得到
马戏表演

07:24.986 --> 07:28.614
Time for phase two.
第二阶段的时间到了。

07:28.698 --> 07:31.951
Chum on a stick, get your
fresh chum right here.
密友在棍子上，得到你的
新鲜的朋友就在这里。

07:32.034 --> 07:34.787
Some chum for you, miss?
小姐，给你找个密友吗？

07:34.871 --> 07:37.957
Well, all this waiting around
for someone to get mauled
is making me a bit hungry.
好吧，这一切都在等待
让某人受到伤害
让我有点饿了。

07:38.040 --> 07:40.042
Here, take this one.
给，拿这个。

07:40.126 --> 07:42.587
It's fresh and warm,
like my hospitality.
是清新又温暖，
就像我的热情好客一样。

07:42.670 --> 07:43.880
Why, thank you.
为什么，谢谢。

07:43.963 --> 07:45.423
Just $10, please.
只需 10 美元。

07:45.506 --> 07:47.967
Ten dollars?
十块钱？

07:48.050 --> 07:51.262
Why would I pay $10
when I can go across the street
and get a Krabby Patty for $1?
为什么我要付 10 美元
当我可以过马路时
花 1 美元买一份蟹肉饼？

07:51.345 --> 07:53.723
Exactly.
确切地。

07:53.806 --> 07:57.602
You don't get
this kind of entertainment
with a Krabby Patty, do you?
你不明白
这种娱乐活动
和蟹肉饼一起吃，你喜欢吗？

07:57.685 --> 07:59.645
No, I suppose not.
不，我想不是。

07:59.729 --> 08:01.606
Ten dollars or the fight's off.
十美元，否则战斗结束。

08:01.689 --> 08:03.816
Fine, whatever.
好吧，无论如何。

08:03.900 --> 08:05.985
There you are.
你就在那里。

08:06.068 --> 08:09.488
I'm sure I've made a satisfied
customer of you already.
我确信我已经做出了满意的
已经是您的客户了。

08:12.408 --> 08:13.743
That was appalling.
那太可怕了。

08:13.826 --> 08:15.244
What was in that?
那里面是什么？

08:15.328 --> 08:18.039
Oh, just the usual ingredients.
哦，只是常见的成分。

08:18.122 --> 08:23.336
Some jellyfish squeezings,
whale blubber, seahorse snout,
and a sprinkle of anchor rust.
有些水母在挤压，
鲸脂、海马口鼻、
和一点锚锈。

08:27.715 --> 08:29.884
Oh, barnacles, that's foul.
哦，藤壶，那是犯规的。

08:31.594 --> 08:35.014
Fish: Did you see that?
鱼：你看到了吗？

08:35.932 --> 08:42.688
Now... I've been waiting for
20 years to have the amount of
customers Krabs sees every day
现在...我一直在等待
20年拥有量
Krabs 每天见到的顾客

08:42.772 --> 08:46.651
and I won't let that be ruined
because the show's boring
我不会让这一切被毁掉
因为节目很无聊

08:46.734 --> 08:48.736
or the food's inedible.
或食物不可食用。

08:48.819 --> 08:52.031
So sit down, enjoy the show,
and buy some chum.
所以坐下来欣赏表演吧
并买一些密友。

08:55.159 --> 08:57.745
What'll we do now, Patrick?
我们现在该怎么办，帕特里克？

08:57.828 --> 09:00.539
Don't worry, I'm already
doing it.
别担心，我已经
做它。

09:00.623 --> 09:02.291
No!
不！

09:02.375 --> 09:05.336
Patrick, now is not the time
for eating.
帕特里克，现在还不是时候
为了吃饭。

09:05.419 --> 09:09.840
Now is the time to avoid being
eaten by that giant... Huh?
现在是时候避免成为
被那个巨人吃掉了……啊？

09:12.885 --> 09:14.053
that's it, Patrick.
就是这样，帕特里克。

09:14.136 --> 09:16.806
He's not chasing us.
他没有追我们。

09:16.889 --> 09:21.185
He's chasing those tasty,
tender, delicious, succulent
sausages around your neck.
他追逐那些美味，
嫩，美味，多汁
脖子上挂着香肠。

09:25.982 --> 09:28.567
chum on a stick, get your chum.
密友在棍子上，抓住你的密友。

09:28.651 --> 09:31.362
What the... Oof!
这是什么……哎呀！

09:35.700 --> 09:39.578
Oh, great, now how am I gonna
entertain the masses?
哦，太好了，现在我该怎么办
娱乐大众？

09:41.038 --> 09:42.873
Hey, watch where you're...
嘿，看你在哪儿……

09:44.917 --> 09:46.836
Oh, dear.
哦亲爱的。

09:59.598 --> 10:03.978
Whoo... Good thing I thought
ahead with that escape door.
呼...我以为是好事
在那扇逃生门前面。

10:04.061 --> 10:06.731
Try and catch me now,
you prissy feline.
现在就试着抓住我吧
你这个小心眼的猫科动物。

10:10.943 --> 10:13.446
No!
不！

10:15.489 --> 10:18.701
Nice kitty... Want some chum?
漂亮的小猫...想要一些好友吗？

10:22.413 --> 10:25.625
You know I'm not one
to give out compliments lightly
你知道我不是一个人
轻轻地给予赞美

10:25.708 --> 10:29.628
but I gotta hand it to you boys,
if you didn't throw those
sausages into the audience
但我必须把它交给你们，孩子们，
如果你没有扔掉那些
香肠进入观众席

10:29.712 --> 10:31.172
we would've been dead meat.
我们就已经死了。

10:31.255 --> 10:32.673
My pleasure, cap'n.
我很荣幸，船长。

10:32.757 --> 10:34.133
Yeah, thanks, buddy.
是的，谢谢，伙计。

10:34.216 --> 10:36.469
You really saved my behind.
你真是救了我的后腿。

10:36.552 --> 10:38.971
No joke.
不是开玩笑。

10:39.055 --> 10:44.060
I think it's safe to say that
no matter how diabolical
Plankton's plans may be
我认为可以肯定地说
无论多么邪恶
浮游生物的计划可能是

10:44.143 --> 10:48.147
he'll never have the loyalty...
of me good customers.
他永远不会有忠诚...
我的好客户。

10:48.230 --> 10:50.149
One Krabby Patty, please.
请来一份蟹肉饼。

10:50.232 --> 10:52.610
But of course, my good customer.
当然，我的好顾客。

10:52.693 --> 10:54.236
That'll be $10.
那将是 10 美元。

10:54.320 --> 10:56.822
Ten dollars,
what happened to $1?
十块钱，
1 美元怎么了？

10:56.906 --> 11:00.618
Perhaps
you'd like to speak to
our financial expert.
也许
你想和
我们的财务专家。

11:02.078 --> 11:05.414
Stupid inflation.
愚蠢的通货膨胀。

11:05.498 --> 11:08.876
Thanks for your business.
感谢您的惠顾。

11:53.087 --> 11:56.549
Sounds like Squidward ate
at Mario's last night.
听起来像章鱼哥吃了
昨晚在马里奥家。

11:58.717 --> 12:00.803
Good thing no one's around
to notice his embarrassing...
还好周围没人
才发现他的尴尬……

12:00.886 --> 12:03.347
Those
construction workers.
那些
建筑工人。

12:03.431 --> 12:06.350
Squidward will die
of embarrassment
if they hear his dilemma.
章鱼哥会死
尴尬的
如果他们听到他的困境。

12:06.434 --> 12:08.310
Poor Squidward.
可怜的章鱼哥。

12:08.394 --> 12:10.771
He must be in too much pain
to make courtesy noises.
他一定是太痛苦了
发出礼貌的声音。

12:12.565 --> 12:15.526
I'll cover for him.
我来掩护他。

12:16.819 --> 12:19.613
Whoa!
哇！

12:19.697 --> 12:21.073
Sorry, fellas.
抱歉，伙计们。

12:21.157 --> 12:24.285
This sure is a noisy trowel.
这肯定是一把吵闹的抹子。

12:25.744 --> 12:26.912
Listen to this thing.
听听这件事。

12:30.666 --> 12:32.418
Oh, I really should get it...
哦，我真的应该得到它......

12:32.501 --> 12:36.213
La-La-La-La...
Blah, blah, blah, blah...
啦啦啦啦啦……
巴拉、巴拉、巴拉、巴拉……

12:38.841 --> 12:40.634
SpongeBob, can you keep it down?
海绵宝宝，你能小声点吗？

12:40.718 --> 12:44.138
I am trying to hone
my musical talent here.
我正在努力磨练
我的音乐天赋在这里。

12:44.221 --> 12:46.432
You mean that wasn't
gastrointestinal distress?
你的意思是那不是
肠胃不适？

12:46.515 --> 12:48.893
And you guys...
还有你们...

12:48.976 --> 12:51.770
Do you really think
that billboard is more important
than my musical genius?
你真的认为
那个广告牌更重要
比我的音乐天才？

12:51.854 --> 12:57.401
Well, sorry, but some of us
rather enjoy the Bikini Bottom
symphony orchestra.
好吧，抱歉，但是我们中的一些人
而是享受比基尼泳裤
交响乐团。

12:57.485 --> 13:00.112
Bikini Bottom
symphony orchestra?
比基尼泳裤
交响乐团？

13:00.196 --> 13:05.367
And we find their
public announcements to be
quite interesting.
我们找到他们的
须予以公开公告
很有趣。

13:05.451 --> 13:07.953
Squidward: Original
compositions wanted?
章鱼哥：原版
想要作品吗？

13:08.037 --> 13:10.664
Me, a famous composer?
我，一个著名的作曲家？

13:16.253 --> 13:18.380
Thank you, thank you.
谢谢，谢谢。

13:44.740 --> 13:48.285
That would be nice.
那太好了。

13:49.995 --> 13:51.288
Ew.
呃。

13:51.372 --> 13:55.125
Whoo-hoo, yeah, yeah!
呼呼，是啊是啊！

13:55.209 --> 13:57.962
You've really made him happy.
你真的让他很开心。

13:58.045 --> 14:00.756
I know what I've done.
我知道我做了什么。

14:00.839 --> 14:03.551
OK...
好的...

14:03.634 --> 14:05.678
OK.
好的。

14:08.264 --> 14:09.765
Pull it together, Squidward.
齐心协力，章鱼哥。

14:09.848 --> 14:12.810
Put your game face on.
戴上你的游戏脸。

14:12.893 --> 14:15.854
Ah, that's better.
啊，这样好多了。

14:15.938 --> 14:18.899
Take your time with this one,
Squidward, old boy.
花点时间看看这个，
章鱼哥，老男孩。

14:23.696 --> 14:24.905
Due tomorrow?
明天到期吗？

14:27.283 --> 14:29.577
Only one day
to write my masterpiece.
只有一天
写出我的杰作。

14:29.660 --> 14:32.288
Don't worry, Squidward,
we'll do it together.
别担心，章鱼哥
我们会一起做的。

14:32.371 --> 14:33.622
No!
不！

14:36.333 --> 14:38.252
Get out!
出去！

14:41.547 --> 14:42.965
Patrick, what are you
doing here?
帕特里克，你是什么？
在这里做什么？

14:43.048 --> 14:45.926
Uh, I don't know.
呃，我不知道。

14:46.010 --> 14:47.761
I'm funny.
我很有趣。

14:51.265 --> 14:53.058
Are you sure you don't need
any help, Squidward?
你确定你不需要
有什么帮助吗，章鱼哥？

14:53.142 --> 14:54.935
No, thank you.
不，谢谢。

14:55.019 --> 14:58.022
I am a solitary artiste.
我是一个孤独的艺术家。

15:00.149 --> 15:02.192
Oh... SpongeBob?
哦...海绵宝宝？

15:02.276 --> 15:03.736
Yes, Patrick?
是的，帕特里克？

15:03.819 --> 15:06.030
I think I broke my bottom.
我想我已经伤透了我的底线。

15:06.113 --> 15:09.575
: Oh, broke your
bottom, oh, Patrick,
you're a card.
: 哦，把你的摔坏了
底部，哦，帕特里克，
你是一张卡。

15:09.658 --> 15:11.702
Whoa...
哇...

15:11.785 --> 15:15.497
Yeah...
是的...

15:17.791 --> 15:20.586
Oh... Much better.
哦...好多了。

15:20.669 --> 15:22.671
Hey, Patrick, I think
you should see a doctor.
嘿，帕特里克，我想
你应该去看医生。

15:22.755 --> 15:24.590
I can't see a doctor.
我看不到医生。

15:24.673 --> 15:26.717
My job doesn't provide me
with health insurance.
我的工作无法为我提供
有健康保险。

15:26.800 --> 15:27.843
What job is that?
那是什么工作？

15:27.926 --> 15:30.429
Exactly.
确切地。

15:30.512 --> 15:33.390
I am a genius.
我是一个天才。

15:33.474 --> 15:35.267
SpongeBob: The doctor will
see you now, Mr. Star.
海绵宝宝：医生会的
现在见，星星先生。

15:49.823 --> 15:52.910
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm, mm-hmm.
嗯嗯，嗯嗯，嗯嗯。

15:52.993 --> 15:55.287
Can't you two be quiet
for one day?
你们两个就不能安静一点吗
一天？

15:55.371 --> 15:57.581
My composition is due tomorrow.
我的作文明天就要交了。

15:57.665 --> 15:59.166
Oh, no... No, no, no,
no, no, no, no.
哦，不……不，不，不，
不，不，不，不。

15:59.249 --> 16:00.959
My patient is very sick.
我的病人病得很重。

16:01.043 --> 16:03.087
Hey, I broke my butt.
嘿嘿，我屁股断了。

16:03.170 --> 16:05.464
Oh...
哦...

16:05.547 --> 16:07.883
Become famous, revenge later.
成名之后，报仇。

16:07.966 --> 16:09.301
Hmm.
唔。

16:09.385 --> 16:10.803
Squidward: Come on...
章鱼哥：来吧……

16:13.097 --> 16:16.934
Be inspired...
受到启发...

16:20.187 --> 16:22.856
Chorus: ♪ Ahh... ♪
合唱：♪ 啊...♪

16:25.234 --> 16:27.152
Brilliant.
杰出的。

16:35.994 --> 16:38.330
No!
不！

16:38.414 --> 16:40.374
why?
为什么？

16:40.457 --> 16:43.669
Why, why, oh, why?
为什么，为什么，哦，为什么？

16:53.262 --> 16:55.472
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm, mm-mmm.
嗯嗯，嗯嗯，嗯嗯。

17:03.605 --> 17:07.359
Ahh...
啊...

17:18.912 --> 17:21.081
Patrick: Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo.
帕特里克：呼呼呼呼。

17:48.609 --> 17:50.736
I did it.
我做到了。

17:52.112 --> 17:55.783
Yes.
是的。

17:55.866 --> 17:59.870
I did it, I did it, I did it,
I did it, and I did it.
我做到了，我做到了，我做到了，
我做到了，我做到了。

17:59.953 --> 18:03.332
Did what?
做了什么？

18:03.415 --> 18:06.752
Squidward: Whoo-hoo...
章鱼哥：呼呼……

18:06.835 --> 18:09.963
Here you go, maestro...
My masterpiece.
来了，大师...
我的杰作。

18:10.047 --> 18:15.552
Hmm... Oh, very unusual.
嗯……哦，很不寻常。

18:15.636 --> 18:19.681
I think we have our winner,
Mr. Tentacles.
我认为我们已经获胜了
触手先生。

18:19.765 --> 18:23.268
Good evening, music lovers
of Bikini Bottom.
晚上好，音乐爱好者们
的比基尼底部。

18:23.352 --> 18:25.437
Tonight is the premiere
of a new symphony
今晚是首映
一首新交响曲

18:25.521 --> 18:28.649
written by one of our own,
Squidward Tentacles.
由我们自己的人写的，
章鱼哥的触手。

19:22.077 --> 19:23.203
Squidward: Huh?
章鱼哥：啊？

19:30.669 --> 19:34.840
I wrote down everything
I heard?
我写下了一切
我听说了？

19:34.923 --> 19:36.800
Fish: Is this
this modern stuff?
鱼：是这个吗
这种现代的东西？

19:36.884 --> 19:39.094
Oh...
哦...

19:46.643 --> 19:48.186
That's gonna leave a mark.
那会留下痕迹的

19:53.317 --> 19:55.569
Patrick: Whoa.
帕特里克：哇哦。

19:55.652 --> 19:57.779
Whoo!
呼！

19:57.863 --> 19:59.865
Whoo-hoo-hoo!
呼呼呼！

20:15.464 --> 20:19.134
Mmm... Mm-hmm.
嗯……嗯嗯。

20:30.812 --> 20:34.316
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

20:44.368 --> 20:47.412
Whoo!
呼！

20:47.496 --> 20:50.457
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

21:23.198 --> 21:25.200
That poor guy.
那个可怜的家伙。

21:31.707 --> 21:35.127
Patrick, get off of me.
帕特里克，从我身上下来。

21:50.058 --> 21:52.853
Fish: Ooh, now that's
what I call music.
鱼：噢，现在是这样
我所说的音乐。

21:52.936 --> 21:55.355
That little yellow guy
is awesome.
那个小黄人
太棒了。

21:55.439 --> 21:57.482
Let us not forget
the tubby starfish.
让我们不要忘记
胖乎乎的海星

21:57.566 --> 22:01.153
Oh, yeah, but the real genius
is the composer.
哦，是的，但是真正的天才
是作曲家。

22:01.236 --> 22:05.657
Audience: Squidward, Squidward,
Squidward, Squidward...
观众：章鱼哥，章鱼哥，
章鱼哥，章鱼哥……

22:05.741 --> 22:09.077
Squidward, Squidward,
Squidward...
章鱼哥，章鱼哥，
章鱼哥...

22:09.161 --> 22:11.663
Wow, Squidward,
they really like you.
哇，章鱼哥，
他们真的很喜欢你。

22:11.747 --> 22:13.206
Just don't get a swelled head.
只是别把头弄肿了。

22:20.881 --> 22:31.850
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪

22:31.933 --> 22:42.861
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪

22:42.944 --> 22:53.872
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
